  "descriptions": [
    "In the heart of Gulf Shores, within walking distance of shops, restaurants, and entertainment, Jetty Life is a well-appointed home perfect for up to 13 guests. You’ll love the location, plus the spacious balcony overlooking the outdoor community pool nestled within the palm trees.",
    "Living Spaces\nJetty Life features a completely open floor plan, with a perfectly inviting living area. Two sofas and a beautiful accent chair are set around a large coffee table just waiting for family game nights, and a wall-mounted flatscreen TV for some downtime.",
    "Kitchen & Dining\nThe fully-stocked, open-concept kitchen overlooks the living area, with wood cabinets, granite countertops, and a huge island with bar seating for two. It’s easy to make meals and snacks for the crew with stainless steel appliances, drip and pod coffee makers, a blender, a toaster, and more. Right next to the kitchen, gather at the eight-person dining table to reminisce about a fun-filled day and plan the next."
  ],
